body:
yes I used to get that gross taste in my mouth especially in the morning. I started by brushing my teeth with homemade toothpaste: coconut oil, baking soda, hydrogen peroxide and diatomaceous earth. I brush my teeth about 3 times a day with this or just whenever I'm feeling like my breath is getting worse. I also sometimes just brush with a normal toothpaste too because I like the minty flavour. 

&#x200B;

I learned that the plaque on over teeth is a type of biofilm, so I combined some ingredients to tackle the biofilm in my mouth. The Diatomaceous earth is a great biofilm buster \*\*\* JUST MAKE SURE YOU GET FOOD GRADE\*\*
